# x86_64 baseline of the final hardening build.
# Measured locally with scripts/check-sizes.sh on the reference desktop,
# built from commit 70e9984 (tree clean apart from documentation), rustc
# 1.98.1 from rust-toolchain.toml, release profile (fat LTO,
# codegen-units=1, panic=abort, strip). The sources of the shipped
# binaries changed since the previous baseline (420a714) by the second
# buffer's first-touch move, the Undo/Trash ownership rule and the
# measurement markers.
# The per-area account of the growth over the Plan 7 baseline
# (inacircle 900352 671864) is in docs/benchmarks/binary-size.md.
inacircle 1105536 841176
inacircle-text 695000 397314
inacircle-pages 448016 357747
